 the world, and see how your choices begin to shape the story.Take a first look at Crimson Frontier: Youth in our trailer:🎮 How to p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T17:11:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941767","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4486770-1841579228677580","game_id":"steam-4486770","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Diary #002: Building the World of Crimson Frontier: Youth","summary":"Hello everyone!In our first developer diary, we talked about the characters of Crimson Frontier: Youth — how their personalities, stories, and roles in the narrative gradually take shape as visual designs.In this developer diary, we’re talking about the environments of Crimson Frontier: Youth — how locations are created, how the script is transformed into visual spaces, and how color, lighting, and small everyday details help reveal the world of the game. Evgeniy Khe, Lead Background Concept Art","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T07:55:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228677580","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4486770-1840944183779269","game_id":"steam-4486770","kind":"announcement","title":"Developer Diary #001: Creating the Characters of Crimson Frontier: Youth","summary":"Hello everyone!Today we’re kicking off a new series of development posts about Crimson Frontier: Youth.In these devlogs, we’ll take you behind the scenes of our audiovisual novel, introduce different members of the team, and show how the game evolves from ideas and sketches into the world you’ll eventually experience on screen.For our first devlog, we’re starting with one of the most 